                <note rend="inline" type="source">714.1515/56: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Guatemala</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Thurston</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-01-09T19:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 9,
                                1918, 7 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your January 7, 10 a.m.</p>
                <p>Department is desirous of having both Governments conclude a boundary treaty.
                    Continue to urge desirability of this step upon Guatemalan Government.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
